      "digest": "51ee2ae522e20a37",
      "alt": "M2H-MX architecture diagram. A DINOv3 backbone with LoRA adaptation feeds token reassembly and a feature pyramid, then register-gated Mamba blocks at each scale, task adaptors, a cross-task mixer, multi-scale convolutional attention, and finally the task heads.",
