      "bytes": {
        "stairs-zupt.mp4": 7054185,
        "stairs-zupt.webm": 1295193,
        "stairs-zupt-poster.jpg": 90205
      },
      "alt": "Screen recording on the drone's Jetson. An rviz window shows predicted depth, tracked features, and predicted semantics down the left, and the estimated trajectory climbing a stairwell in the centre, labelled MOVING while the drone is in motion and ZUPT STATIONARY while it is still.",
      "caption": "Depth-backed visual-inertial odometry running on the drone's Jetson, walked up and down the stairs at home. The label switches between MOVING and ZUPT STATIONARY: when the platform is still, zero-velocity updates pin the estimate so it does not drift while nothing is happening. Predicted depth, tracked features, and predicted semantics are the panels on the left.",
      "credit": "Mono-Hydra++ VIO",
      "clickToLoad": false
    }
